            <ul class="sub-list">
              <li>An assured monthly pension of <strong>50% of the average basic pay</strong> drawn over the last 12 months prior to retirement for employees completing 25 years of qualifying service.</li>
              <li>A statutory minimum pension floor of <strong>₹10,000 per month</strong> for employees completing at least 10 years of service.</li>
